    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Legendary (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>While attuned to this golden feather, you can take a Magic action to make a pair of glowing golden wings sprout from your back. The wings give you a Fly Speed of 80 feet, and any creature that makes an Opportunity Attack against you when you fly out of its reach has Disadvantage on that attack roll. If you fall while you have the wings, you descend at 60 feet per round until you land.</p><p>The wings last until you dismiss them as a Magic action or your Attunement ends. If you are aloft when the wings disappear, you fall.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-4HOqi14QuIcYeTFH\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>L’activité <em>Golden Wings</em> active ou retire les ailes (Vitesse de vol de 80 pieds). Le Désavantage des attaques d’opportunité et la chute lente sont à gérer à la main.</p></section>",
